  "privacyTitle": "OpenRing Privacy Policy",
  "privacyEffective": "Effective 2026-11-25",
  "privacyShortHeading": "Short version",
  "privacyShortNoAccount": "OpenRing has no account, no server of its own and no analytics. Nobody behind OpenRing receives your health data.",
  "privacyShortStored": "Your data is stored on your phone, in the app's private storage.",
  "privacyShortInternet": "The app uses the internet for two things: checking for and downloading app updates and, only with AI analysis on, reaching the AI service you chose, which receives only what you approved: a summary of your data, a Goals review decision or a meal photo. Your health data goes over the network in no other way.",
  "privacyShortLeaves": "Health data leaves your phone only when you send it: to Health Connect, if you allow it, in a file you export and share, in a transfer to a new phone you start, or to the AI service you chose, after you see what goes and agree.",
  "privacyStoresHeading": "What the app stores, and why",
  "privacyStoresRing": "Ring name, Bluetooth address and battery level",
  "privacyStoresRingWhy": "To reconnect to your ring and show its battery",
  "privacyStoresRingData": "Steps, distance, active energy, heart rate, SpO2, stress, HRV and sleep stages",
  "privacyStoresRingDataWhy": "To show your days and nights and compute the scores; with the Energy module on, also the estimate of your day's energy; with the Effort module on, also your training load; with the Food module on, also the gap before sleep and your meal comparisons",
  "privacyStoresWorkouts": "Workouts: start, end, type, pauses, heart rate during the workout",
  "privacyStoresWorkoutsWhy": "To record workouts you start; with the Energy module on, also the estimate of your day's energy; with the Effort module on, also your training load",
  "privacyStoresRoutes": "Workout routes: location points during an outdoor workout",
  "privacyStoresRoutesWhy": "To draw the route, compute distance, pace and splits and, with the Open Score module on, estimate your fitness",
  "privacyStoresProfile": "Age, height, weight, sex, maximum heart rate, step goal (all optional)",
  "privacyStoresProfileWhy": "Heart rate zones, the calorie estimate and the scores of the Open Score module; with the Energy module on, also the estimate of your day's energy; with the Effort module on, also your training load",
  "privacyStoresOtherApps": "Sleep sessions and workouts written by other apps, with the name of the app that wrote them (optional, each off by default)",
  "privacyStoresOtherAppsWhy": "To show sleep and workouts from another device when you turn that type on; with the Energy module on, also the estimate of your day's energy; with the Effort module on, also your training load; with the Food module on, also the gap before sleep and your meal comparisons",
  "privacyStoresWeighIns": "Weigh-ins: weight and, if you add them, body fat and waist (optional, Body module)",
  "privacyStoresWeighInsWhy": "To show your weight trend and, with the Open Score module on, to score your body measures; with the Energy module on, also the estimate of your day's energy",
  "privacyStoresDayTags": "Day tags: the days you set aside as sick, travel or rest (optional, Open Score module)",
  "privacyStoresDayTagsWhy": "To leave those days out of your averages; with the Open Score and Effort modules both on, a sick day also makes the coach card say recover",
  "privacyStoresSettings": "Settings: theme, units, sync interval, widget choices, ring alerts, which types go to Health Connect, demo mode, which modules are on, the weekly goal, heart rate on the lock screen, the ring drop alert in a workout",
  "privacyStoresSettingsWhy": "To remember your choices",
  "privacyStoresSummary": "A small summary of today's numbers",
  "privacyStoresSummaryWhy": "To fill the home screen widgets",
  "privacyHealthHeading": "Health Connect",
  "privacyHealthWrites": "Health Connect write: steps, active calories, heart rate, oxygen saturation, heart rate variability, sleep, exercise, exercise route, distance",
  "privacyHealthWritesWhy": "Sending your ring data and workouts to Health Connect, if you allow each type.",
  "privacyHealthReads": "Health Connect read: sleep, exercise",
  "privacyHealthReadsWhy": "Each only if you turn on that type from other apps. Records that OpenRing wrote itself are skipped. With no ring paired, it also asks to read them in the background, so the periodic sync can import them with the app closed.",
  "privacyHealthShare": "If you grant write access, OpenRing writes the types above to Health Connect on the phone. Other apps you allow in Health Connect can then read them. Health Connect is part of Android; its own privacy terms apply, and you manage or delete that data in the Health Connect settings.",
  "privacyDeleteHeading": "How long data is kept, and how to delete it",
  "privacyDeleteKept": "Data stays on your phone until you remove it. You can:",
  "privacyDeleteWorkout": "delete a single workout in the app;",
  "privacyDeleteAll": "remove all OpenRing data with Android Settings, Apps, OpenRing, Storage, Clear storage, or by uninstalling the app;",
  "privacyDeleteHealthConnect": "delete what OpenRing wrote to Health Connect in the Health Connect settings, which also lets you revoke OpenRing's access at any time.",
  "privacyRevoke": "Revoking a permission stops the matching feature; it does not delete data the app already stored.",
