  "overallSourceSleepRegularity": "The index: Phillips and colleagues, 2017. The link with health: Windred and colleagues, 2024, and Cribb and colleagues, 2023, both with adults of the UK Biobank.",
  "overallOursSleepRegularity": "The two marks and the weight of {points} points are our choice, not taken from a study. In those studies few people passed 75.",
