  "energyWhatResting": "The energy your body uses in 24 hours lying still and awake: breathing, heartbeat, keeping warm. It is the largest part of any day, and it barely changes from one day to the next.",
  "energyRuleResting": "The Mifflin St Jeor equation: {perKg} × weight in kg, plus {perCm} × height in cm, minus {perYear} × age, then plus {male} for men or minus {female} for women. The screen shows {margin} percent to each side, rounded to the nearest {step}.",
