  "@energyLimitsResting": {"placeholders": {"age": {"type": "String"}}},
  "energyWhatBase": "The part of the day that happens without you doing anything on purpose: your resting burn, plus digesting food and the small movements no sensor counts, like standing, chores and fidgeting.",
