  "@energyOursSteps": {"placeholders": {"cost": {"type": "String"}}},
  "energyLimitsSteps": "Hills, stairs, a heavy bag and your pace all change the real cost. In a 2017 test of seven wrist devices (Shcherbina and colleagues) the best one was off by 27 percent on energy.",
  "energyWhatWorkouts": "The extra energy of each workout you recorded or imported, above what you would have used at rest in the same minutes.",
