  "effortFormulaRuleNoReadiness": "No readiness number this morning",
  "effortFormulaCoachNote": "A hard day is a daily load of {floor} or more that is also at least {factor} times your {chronic} day line as it stood the day before. An easy day is under {easy} percent of the {chronic} day line. Rule {sick} reads the Sick tag of Open Score, only while Open Score is on.",
