  "aiFormulaLevel": "{level, select, minimal{Scores, load, steps, weekly averages, trends and the goal, with relative days. Age in a 10 year band. Weight only as a change.} standard{Adds sleep stages and times, heart, workouts, weight, energy, food and the plan. Age in a 5 year band, times rounded to 15 minutes, relative days.} other{Exact age, calendar dates and times to the minute. Only this level can use the long window: up to {days} days and {weeks} weeks.}}",
