  "aiFormulaFactsTitle": "The facts the model may cite",
  "aiFormulaFactsBody": "The app builds a numbered list of facts: latest value, baseline, averages and trends. The model may use a number only by citing a fact. A fact with fewer than {min} days of data is left out of the list.",
  "@aiFormulaFactsBody": {"placeholders": {"min": {"type": "int"}}},
  "aiFormulaCheckTitle": "How each card is checked",
  "aiFormulaRule": "{rule, select, cited{The card cites from 1 to {maxCited} facts, and every one exists in the summary that was sent.} theme{The card's theme matches at least one cited fact, as sleep with a sleep fact. A card about the whole picture may cite any fact.} numbers{Every number in the title and the text is a cited fact, as is or rounded, the difference or percent change between two cited facts, or a count of days, nights, weeks or mornings: up to the days sent, or {periods}. Clock times and labels such as W2 are not checked.} action{The suggestion has numbers only with a time or activity unit (minutes, hours, days, nights, weeks, steps). A number with bpm, ms, %, kg, kcal or mg drops the card.} words{Words of diagnosis, disease, medicine, supplements or dose drop the card.} other{An address starting with http or www, or a Markdown link, drops the card.}}",
